    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Richard, Gilles et Philippe sont amis depuis pr\u00e8s de cinquante ans. Le temps d\u2019un \u00e9t\u00e9, ils embarquent avec leurs compagnes sur un magnifique voilier pour une croisi\u00e8re vers la Corse. Mais la cohabitation \u00e0 bord d\u2019un bateau n\u2019est pas toujours facile. D\u2019autant que chaque couple a ses probl\u00e8mes, et que la m\u00e9t\u00e9o leur r\u00e9serve de grosses surprises... Entre rires et confessions, griefs et jalousies vont remonter \u00e0 la surface. Chacun va devoir faire le point sur sa vie et sur ses relations aux autres. L\u2019amiti\u00e9 r\u00e9sistera-t-elle au gros temps ?",
        "english": "Richard, Gilles, and Philippe have been friends for almost fifty years. One summer, they set out on a cruise with their girlfriends on a magnificent yacht, heading for Corsica. But shared living on board the boat isn't always easy. Even more so given that each couple has its own problems, and the weather provides them with some major surprises. Between laughter and confessions, grievances and jalousies will rise to the surface. Everyone has to take a look at their lives and their relationships with the others. Will friendship survive the stormy weather?"
    },
